spoiler":false,"text":"Mirai's twin brother, and the younger sibling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Minato is quiet and pure-hearted, but gets teased a lot by his sister. His feminine appearance and cute honest character has made him very popular with the girls in his class. He holds Hiroaki in high regard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7738"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"みらいの双子の弟。みらいとは対照的に、控えめでおとなしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"健気で一途。自己主張が少なく、つい遠慮して損をしてしまうタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分からねだることはないが、主人公に抱きしめてもらうのが大好き。胸の中では、「あう……」と幸せすぎて何もしゃべれなくなってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26216","sourceWorkId":"6373","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"みらいの双子の弟。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしくて健気。よく姉のみらいにいじめられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女の子っぽい外見と従順な性格が可愛いと、クラスの女子に人気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に好意を抱いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「えっと……ボク……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89743"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f77f8311d0eca562cd52d1eb1f0a2060348d89ea8b490609057bb97ccfd710fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c32ded01c2232a48ac4bcdf927ca18c361a083cecb63e3523276a927797de0b9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:313754:89743:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7740","characterName":"鶴見　つばさ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"108818","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"313754"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26217"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7740"},"originalCharacterName":"鶴見　つばさ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young boy who's best friends with Minato. Appointed as the \"leader\" of his class, Tsubasa is very popular with girls. He gets jealous after seeing how close Minato and Hiroyuki have become."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7740"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強もできて、スポーツも得意……という、クラスのリーダー的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みなととは、小さい頃からの親友。みなとを特別意識している訳ではないが、可愛らしい仕草に時々ドキッとしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友のみなとを取られたと思い、主人公に敵意を抱いている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26217","sourceWorkId":"6373","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勉強もできて、スポーツも得意……という、クラスのリーダー的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みなととは、小さい頃からの親友。みなとを特別意識している訳ではないが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしい仕草に時々ドキッとしてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友のみなとを取られたと思い、主人公に敵意を抱いている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"108818"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f8c34f8fed1168714a3e27880cb6e1cdb60e0ed00da5a66b4ebfc2f11752d95.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afff7df1b9e2fbb47bbf15cd33868a5e9aae43313b45452bb9d101548e1cafae.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春奈 有美","creatorId":"vndb:s1634","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1634","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1634","name":"木川 絵理子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:27857","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7742","characterName":"桜川　みらい","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"89742","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"313754"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26215"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7742"},"originalCharacterName":"桜川　みらい","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Minato's twin sister, and the older sibling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mirai is strong-willed, and has been appointed the \"leader\" of her group of friends. (which includes herself, Yachiyo, and Marin.) She loves Hiroaki and clings to him a lot, trying to help him with his work. But she's also very tsundere, and gets flustered easily."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's a very active girl who likes energetic activities."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7742"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"みなとの双子の姉。根は優しいがやきもち焼きで、ちょっとわがままな一面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことが大好きでいろいろ世話を焼きたいのだが、恥ずかしいから仕方なくやっているといった風を装っている。主人公のだらしない姿に「んもう……」とため息をつくのが癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じクラスのまりん、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やちよとは仲良し3人組。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26215","sourceWorkId":"6373","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"みなとの双子の姉。仲良し３人組（みらい、やちよ、まりん）のリーダー格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことが大好きで、よく世話を焼いている。しかし、照れくさいので仕方なくやっているように装っているツンデレ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体を動かすことが好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄ちゃん、ヘンタイ……」（じとー）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「んもう……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"89742"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fea41f17e4da8e7e8f2b6435b6be0a263a2576238ef4cb2f1add872ac7c746d7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c0ff936909634d5659af7074fdeaab7a20768e644817b1e9e576dcedcf51ead.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:313754:89742:6038:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7743","characterName":"氷川　まりん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"108819","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"313754"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26218"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7743"},"originalCharacterName":"氷川　まりん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The energetic mood-maker of her friend group. Marin's not a very good student, but she's skilled in other places, especially sports. She's interested in sex, and wants to learn lots of things about it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7743"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも元気ハツラツ、3人組のムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体を動かすことが大好きで、スポーツ万能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなスポーツでもすぐに順応してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称・巨乳。むちむちばいーんな巨乳美人に憧れている。　最近は、Ｈなコトと色恋沙汰に興味津々らしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26218","sourceWorkId":"6373","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつでも元気ハツラツ、3人組のムードメーカー。身体を動かすことが大好きで、スポーツ万能。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どんなスポーツでもすぐに順応してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称・巨乳。むちむちばいーんな巨乳美人に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近は、Hなコトと色恋沙汰に興味津々らしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"108819"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a69ba3bb04a7f560bb56b4553f52906c11639b4a3e6671d96377eedb960da71e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4fa04808cf2d0a7a4165a36a76b8c2b72f97a35b788ace13c8f472f169e21f7.webp","width":217,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金田 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:27856","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7744","characterName":"妙香寺 やちよ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"108820","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"313754"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26219"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7744"},"originalCharacterName":"妙香寺 やちよ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The \"brains\" and voice of reason within her group of friends. However, she gets overlooked a lot by Mirai and Marin and their unstoppable energy. She's a bit of an otaku, and often fantasizes about yaoi situations between Minato and Tsubasa. Yachiyo has a gentle soul, and bonds with Hiroyuki about their shared interests and admires him a lot."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7744"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おしとやかな性格。成績は常に学年トップクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古典文学の世界からオタク分野まで、趣味の幅は広い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近、クラブの先輩をオタクの道に引きずり込んでしまったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"3人組の中では（ごく僅差であるが）最もバストサイズが大きく、巨乳美人を目指すまりんから一方的にライバル視されている"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26219","sourceWorkId":"6373","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"おしとやかな性格。成績は常に学年トップクラス。古典文学の世界からオタク分野まで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味の幅は広い。最近、クラブの先輩をオタクの道に引きずり込んでしまったらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"3人組の中では（ごく僅差であるが）最もバストサイズが大きく、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巨乳美人を目指すまりんから一方的にライバル視されている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"108820"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/102b0fea62ac7df8211b05e423347289550d9c13cc7f9024abaca137484e3aae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a